{"3595140":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ORION SHOOTER - オリオンシューター","steam_appid":3595140,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to bring more excitement to my hometown, Utsunomiya City in Tochigi Prefecture...!&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from that passion, Orion Shooter is a side-scrolling shooting game that you can casually enjoy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with unique local flavor, the game features dream collaborations with beloved characters, organizations, and shops active in Tochigi Prefecture. Enjoy the one-of-a-kind identity and local charm that only this title can offer!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Operation instructions]<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>《Keyboard and mouse operations》<\/strong><\/u><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>W, A, S, D keys \/ Cursor keys<\/strong><br>Equivalent to the cross pad (All: Move cursor up\/down\/left\/right During gameplay: Move ship up\/down\/left\/right)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space key<\/strong><br>Equivalent to the A button (All: Confirm During gameplay: Shot)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X key<\/strong><br>Equivalent to the B button (All: Back During gameplay: Skill)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift key<\/strong><br>During gameplay: Move slowly while pressed<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC key<\/strong><br>Title: Display game credits During gameplay: Pause, cancel pause<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left mouse click<\/strong><br>Confirm<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right mouse click<\/strong><br>Back<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>《Gamepad operations》<\/strong><\/u><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross pad \/ Left stick<\/strong><br>Cross pad (Move ship up\/down\/left\/right, move cursor up\/down\/left\/right)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A button<\/strong><br>A button (All: Confirm During gameplay: Shot)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B button<\/strong><br>B button (All: Back During gameplay: Skill)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L1 button<\/strong><br>During gameplay: Move slowly while pressed<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Menu button<\/strong><br>During gameplay: Pause, cancel pause<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Introduction &amp; Story]<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/090a2bdd5c485b6e4b45cf9ecadf18ab.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/090a2bdd5c485b6e4b45cf9ecadf18ab.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=450 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling shooting game that's easy to understand and enjoy for players of all levels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final stage, you'll face off against real-life local heroes and characters who have been brainwashed by the Demon King's magic—individuals who usually work hard to promote and support the community.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/509fe875a9a55914ff075d78fa40cb6d.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/509fe875a9a55914ff075d78fa40cb6d.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=532 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/289cb3e7231751f714fe2b95b5d77fee.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/289cb3e7231751f714fe2b95b5d77fee.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=532 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Character Introduction]<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/75411d3ee104a3bf8ff3a03f688b079d.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/75411d3ee104a3bf8ff3a03f688b079d.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=450 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matsuri Aono (CV: Ruka Yashiro)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfectly ordinary otaku girl living somewhere in Utsunomiya City.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She often confuses those around her with her fast-talking and geeky comments...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an energetic personality, she loves festivals and regularly wears her favorite pink happi coat as everyday attire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 20<br>Birthday: July 12<br>Blood Type: O<br>Hobbies: Watching anime \/ Playing games \/ Stargazing (just from her balcony)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/4b0a4dd8187a0042d15eda7f16cf6188.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/4b0a4dd8187a0042d15eda7f16cf6188.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=450 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uni Orion (CV: Yuuri Ichinose)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wand spirit who had long been alone in a magnificent garden atop the tallest tower in the otherworldly “Festa” that Matsuri wandered into.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite her youthful appearance, she claims to have lived for thousands of years. She ends her sentences with the old-fashioned “~ja,” leading Matsuri to nickname her “Noja-Loli.”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's fascinated by modern gadgets like smartphones, which she’s never seen before.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Credit]<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/3d0d697988857e57e5e9beb09a94e0f3.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/3d0d697988857e57e5e9beb09a94e0f3.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=1935 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to bring more excitement to my hometown, Utsunomiya City in Tochigi Prefecture...!&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from that passion, Orion Shooter is a side-scrolling shooting game that you can casually enjoy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with unique local flavor, the game features dream collaborations with beloved characters, organizations, and shops active in Tochigi Prefecture. Enjoy the one-of-a-kind identity and local charm that only this title can offer!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Operation instructions]<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>《Keyboard and mouse operations》<\/strong><\/u><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>W, A, S, D keys \/ Cursor keys<\/strong><br>Equivalent to the cross pad (All: Move cursor up\/down\/left\/right During gameplay: Move ship up\/down\/left\/right)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space key<\/strong><br>Equivalent to the A button (All: Confirm During gameplay: Shot)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X key<\/strong><br>Equivalent to the B button (All: Back During gameplay: Skill)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift key<\/strong><br>During gameplay: Move slowly while pressed<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC key<\/strong><br>Title: Display game credits During gameplay: Pause, cancel pause<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left mouse click<\/strong><br>Confirm<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right mouse click<\/strong><br>Back<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>《Gamepad operations》<\/strong><\/u><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross pad \/ Left stick<\/strong><br>Cross pad (Move ship up\/down\/left\/right, move cursor up\/down\/left\/right)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A button<\/strong><br>A button (All: Confirm During gameplay: Shot)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B button<\/strong><br>B button (All: Back During gameplay: Skill)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L1 button<\/strong><br>During gameplay: Move slowly while pressed<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Menu button<\/strong><br>During gameplay: Pause, cancel pause<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Introduction &amp; Story]<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/090a2bdd5c485b6e4b45cf9ecadf18ab.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/090a2bdd5c485b6e4b45cf9ecadf18ab.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=450 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling shooting game that's easy to understand and enjoy for players of all levels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final stage, you'll face off against real-life local heroes and characters who have been brainwashed by the Demon King's magic—individuals who usually work hard to promote and support the community.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/509fe875a9a55914ff075d78fa40cb6d.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/509fe875a9a55914ff075d78fa40cb6d.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=532 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/289cb3e7231751f714fe2b95b5d77fee.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/289cb3e7231751f714fe2b95b5d77fee.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=532 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Character Introduction]<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/75411d3ee104a3bf8ff3a03f688b079d.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/75411d3ee104a3bf8ff3a03f688b079d.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=450 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matsuri Aono (CV: Ruka Yashiro)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfectly ordinary otaku girl living somewhere in Utsunomiya City.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She often confuses those around her with her fast-talking and geeky comments...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an energetic personality, she loves festivals and regularly wears her favorite pink happi coat as everyday attire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 20<br>Birthday: July 12<br>Blood Type: O<br>Hobbies: Watching anime \/ Playing games \/ Stargazing (just from her balcony)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/4b0a4dd8187a0042d15eda7f16cf6188.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/4b0a4dd8187a0042d15eda7f16cf6188.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=450 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uni Orion (CV: Yuuri Ichinose)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wand spirit who had long been alone in a magnificent garden atop the tallest tower in the otherworldly “Festa” that Matsuri wandered into.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite her youthful appearance, she claims to have lived for thousands of years. She ends her sentences with the old-fashioned “~ja,” leading Matsuri to nickname her “Noja-Loli.”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's fascinated by modern gadgets like smartphones, which she’s never seen before.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Credit]<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras\/3d0d697988857e57e5e9beb09a94e0f3.avif?t=1746151956\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/extras_big\/3d0d697988857e57e5e9beb09a94e0f3.avif?t=1746151956 width=800 height=1935 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Orion Shooter is an easy-to-play side-scrolling shooter game created with the desire to &quot;liven up our hometown, Utsunomiya City, Tochigi Prefecture!&quot; We hope you enjoy the local feel that permeates the game.","supported_languages":"일본어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3595140\/7c9963a4baf5bd2e3b5fcce08815c7df7288b685\/header.jpg?t=1746151956","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_asset